<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    
    <h2>What Is the Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake Blizzard® Treat?</h2>
    <p>The Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake Blizzard is part of DQ's Summer 2026 seasonal lineup. It combines strawberry cheesecake-flavored pieces with a chocolate fudge swirl in DQ soft serve — a fruit-and-chocolate combination that is refreshing for summer while still delivering the indulgent richness expected of a Blizzard. Seasonal Blizzards cost slightly more than core flavors, starting at $4.49 Mini.</p>
  <p>See all seasonal and year-round Blizzards on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> or on the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats page</a>.</p>

    <h2>Summer 2026 Seasonal Blizzard — Limited Time</h2>
  <p>The Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake Blizzard is available for summer 2026 only. Once the summer seasonal rotation ends (typically late August), this flavor will not be available until DQ brings it back in a future season. Other Summer 2026 seasonals include the <a href="/items/smores-blizzard">S'mores Blizzard</a>, <a href="/items/confetti-cake-blizzard">Confetti Cake Blizzard</a>, and <a href="/items/cotton-candy-blizzard">Cotton Candy Blizzard</a>.</p>
  <h2>Price vs. Year-Round Blizzards</h2>
  <p>Seasonal Blizzards start at $4.49 Mini vs. $3.49–$3.99 for standard Blizzards. The premium reflects limited-availability ingredient sourcing. If budget is a priority, the <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Blizzard</a> at $3.49 Mini gives strong value year-round.</p>

    <h2>How It Compares to Other Blizzards</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Flavor Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>540</td><td>Fruit + cheesecake + fudge — summer 2026</td></tr><tr><td>S'mores Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>500</td><td>Graham + marshmallow + fudge — summer 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Confetti Cake Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>490</td><td>Sprinkles + cake — summer 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Oreo® Cookie Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>420</td><td>Year-round classic, lower price</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

    <h2>Ordering Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First timer?</strong> Order a Mini (4.49) — it's 4–5 spoonfuls, perfect for a taste test before committing to a full cup.</li>
      <li><strong>Best size for one person:</strong> Small (5.29) at 540 calories hits the sweet spot of satisfaction without going overboard.</li>
      <li><strong>Upgrade option:</strong> Ask to blend in a hot fudge swirl for richer chocolate depth, or add extra mix-ins (~$0.50).</li>
      <li><strong>Check the flip:</strong> DQ guarantees every Blizzard is thick enough to hold upside down — if your crew doesn't flip it, it's free.</li>
    </ul>

